# Description of the functionality provided by this module
Description = @'
Collects health and status information from infrastructure systems and normalizes every
result onto one status vocabulary (success, warning, error, info) so unrelated sources can
be summarized and rendered together.

Collectors cover certificate expiration (public TLS endpoints and internal AD CS), URI and
DNS reachability probes, Veeam Backup and Replication job results, vCenter triggered alarms,
Cisco UCS Manager faults, ArcGIS Online service status, SolarWinds Orion down nodes, down
interfaces and active alerts, and building HVAC controller alarms.

Get-DailyStatus orchestrates the set: it reads a job configuration collection, dispatches
each entry to its collector as a background job, drains the jobs as they complete, and
attaches per-job severity counts and a worst-case overall health value.

Each collector reports failures as records rather than throwing, so one unreachable system
does not abort a run.
'@

