1.1.0
- Comment-based help added to every function.
- Invoke-WebRequestDH now installs the permissive certificate policy it compiles, so the
  SSL checks can read expired and untrusted certificates instead of failing the handshake.
  The policy and SecurityProtocol are both changed inside the try and restored in the
  finally. Request timeout raised from 2000 ms to 5000 ms, and the policy type is compiled
  once per session rather than on every call.
- Test-URIList no longer requires ComputerName. Omit it, or name the local machine, and the
  probe loop runs in the current session; the loop takes its inputs as parameters so the
  same block serves both paths. A dispatch failure now returns a record in the normal
  Status/URI/Proxy shape.
- Test-DNSServerRemote clears its status variable between iterations.
- Get-TriggeredVMWareAlarms disconnects only the sessions that actually connected.
- Get-AGOStatus evaluates each service against its own event list.
- ConvertFrom-EventList takes the controller IP as a parameter instead of reading it from
  the caller's scope.
- Get-AllVBRJobs reports a failed background job's own failure reason.
- Get-DailyStatus imports the module in every background job, handles an unrecognized job
  type without stalling the drain loop, and no longer aborts the run when a check returns
  nothing.
- Get-CertExpiration ExcludedTemplates now defaults to empty; supply the auto-enrolled
  template OIDs for the environment being checked or the internal report will be noisy.

1.0
- Initial version.
